            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## JoyPointer 1.0.0

First release.

- Use any macOS-compatible game controller as a mouse: left stick or D-pad moves the pointer, right stick scrolls.
- A/B click, hold to drag, Y toggles the macOS on-screen keyboard. Buttons are remappable.
- Automatic suspend while a registered game (including Steam titles) is frontmost.
- Menu bar only, follows the system language (English, Korean, Japanese).
- Lifetime license, activated on up to 3 Macs. Updates arrive through the built-in updater.
]]></description>
